  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\mathrm{A}=\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]$ then $\\mathbf{A}^{100}$ :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "x2ZSO",
      "text": "$2^{100} \\mathrm{~A}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "MBwlD",
      "text": "$2^{99} \\mathrm{~A}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "T3oHk",
      "text": "$2^{101} \\mathrm{~A}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "RvFDn",
      "text": "None of the above",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]$\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n\\mathrm{A}^{2}=\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}\r\n\r\n1 & 1 \\\\\r\n\r\n1 & 1\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\\right]\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}\r\n\r\n1 & 1 \\\\\r\n\r\n1 & 1\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\\right]=2\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}\r\n\r\n1 & 1 \\\\\r\n\r\n1 & 1\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\\right]=2 \\mathrm{~A} \\\\\r\n\r\n\\mathrm{~A}^{3}=2^{2}\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}\r\n\r\n1 & 1 \\\\\r\n\r\n1 & 1\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\\right], \\mathrm{A}^{4}=2^{3}\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}\r\n\r\n1 & 1 \\\\\r\n\r\n1 & 1\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\\right] \\\\\r\n\r\n\\mathrm{A}^{3}=2^{2} \\mathrm{~A}, \\quad \\mathrm{~A}^{4}=2^{3} \\mathrm{~A} \\\\\r\n\r\n\\therefore \\mathrm{A}^{\\mathrm{n}}=2^{\\mathrm{n}-1}\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}\r\n\r\n1 & 1 \\\\\r\n\r\n1 & 1\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\\right] \\\\\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{A}^{100}=2^{100-1} \\mathrm{~A} \\therefore \\mathrm{A}^{100}=2^{99} \\mathrm{~A}\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\r\n\r\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
